          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "MCP endpoint auth model — No issue identified: /mcp\n\nPOST /mcp returns 401 {\"error\":\"unauthorized\"} without Bearer key (MCP-over-HTTP). Tools enumerated from client bundle: whoami, list_vaults, list_secrets, get_secret, create_secret, update_secret, delete_secret, list_templates. Auth enforced at gateway."
