            "text": "Session fixation / cookie attributes / logout — No issue identified: Session cookie (av_session) / /admin/logout\n\nSession cookie av_session is HttpOnly + Secure + SameSite=Strict. Logout clears it (Set-Cookie av_session=; empty). No cookie issued on failed login or unauthenticated /admin/* (401 with no Set-Cookie), so no fixation vector pre-auth. Session predictability untestable without a valid login (no session ever issued unauth)."
