          "message": {
            "text": "DOM XSS / prototype pollution / postMessage / client-side path traversal / localStorage — No issue identified: /ui/* public SPA bundle (index-CrU8J1K5.js)\n\nReact 19.3.0 app (Vite build). All 13 dangerouslySetInnerHTML / 5 innerHTML matches are React's internal renderer (children/__html handling), not app code — no app-level dangerouslySetInnerHTML/__html/eval/Function/document.write. The only onmessage/postMessage is an internal MessageChannel scheduler shim (not window.addEventListener('message')). No new Worker. window.location.hash used solely for component selection via strict equality (t===`agents` etc.), never rendered as HTML. localStorage only for `kerviavault-lang` pref and a no-op getItem(`kerviavault-mk`). No JSON.parse of attacker-controlled storage/hash. No Object.assign into user-influenced objects (React internals only)."
          },
